      "title": "阿里巴巴诚邀学界伙伴共同研究AI前沿课题",
      "url": "https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=Mzg4NTczNzg2OA==&mid=2247509178&idx=1&sn=b1e9a5e2b3713bc3b05a9a0cc8921568",
